#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:1
msgid "Validate outputs"
msgstr "验证输出"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:3
msgid ""
"Validate generated artifacts before runtime loading so file structure, "
"metadata, shard indices, and quantization declarations are checked "
"consistently. Structural validation is one gate in a larger deployment "
"workflow."
msgstr "在运行时加载之前验证生成的工件，以便一致地检查文件结构、元数据、分片索引和量化声明。结构验证是更大部署工作流中的一道关口。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:5
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:7
msgid "Before validation, make sure you have:"
msgstr "验证前，请确保你已具备："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:9
msgid "a completed conversion or quantization output directory"
msgstr "已完成转换或量化的输出目录"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:10
msgid "the full output directory, not only `.safetensors` files"
msgstr "完整输出目录，而不仅是 `.safetensors` 文件"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:11
msgid "the exact command, recipe, model revision, and backend used for generation"
msgstr "生成时使用的确切命令、recipe、模型修订版本和后端"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:12
msgid ""
"access to the target inference framework for runtime checks after structural"
" validation"
msgstr "可访问目标推理框架，以便在结构验证后执行运行时检查"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:14
msgid "Run structural validation"
msgstr "运行结构验证"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:16
msgid "Validate the output directory:"
msgstr "验证输出目录："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:22
msgid "Expected result:"
msgstr "预期结果："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:28
msgid "Save JSON output when reporting or archiving a result:"
msgstr "报告或归档结果时保存 JSON 输出："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:36
msgid "Check the output contract"
msgstr "检查输出契约"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:38
msgid ""
"Keep the entire generated directory together. The required method-specific "
"files differ by output ABI."
msgstr "保持整个生成目录完整。不同输出 ABI 所需的方法专用文件不同。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:40
msgid "Compressed-tensors output normally contains:"
msgstr "compressed-tensors 输出通常包含："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:51
msgid ""
"Native GPTQ or AutoRound output normally contains `config.json`, "
"`quantize_config.json`, native GPTQ tensors and shards, and a native index "
"or single-file weight file when emitted. Native AWQ output normally contains"
" `config.json`, `quant_config.json`, native AWQ tensors and shards, and a "
"native index or single-file weight file when emitted. BF16 conversion can "
"contain `conversion_report.json`."
msgstr ""
"原生 GPTQ 或 AutoRound 输出通常包含 `config.json`、`quantize_config.json`、原生 GPTQ "
"张量和分片，以及生成时的原生索引或单文件权重文件。原生 AWQ 输出通常包含 `config.json`、`quant_config.json`、原生 "
"AWQ 张量和分片，以及生成时的原生索引或单文件权重文件。BF16 转换可能包含 `conversion_report.json`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:54
msgid ""
"Do not publish or copy only the `.safetensors` files. Keep configuration, "
"index or single-file weights, method metadata, quantization metadata, and "
"supporting tokenizer files when they are present."
msgstr "不要只发布或复制 `.safetensors` 文件。存在配置、索引或单文件权重、方法元数据、量化元数据以及支持 tokenizer 文件时，请一并保留。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:57
msgid ""
"See the [output files reference](../reference/output-files.md) for the "
"directory-level contract."
msgstr "目录级契约请参见 [output files reference](../reference/output-files.md)。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:59
msgid "Understand what validation checks"
msgstr "了解验证会检查什么"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:61
msgid "Validation checks generated artifact structure and metadata, including:"
msgstr "验证会检查生成工件的结构和元数据，包括："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:63
msgid "shard and index consistency"
msgstr "分片与索引一致性"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:64
msgid "actual shard tensors corresponding to index entries"
msgstr "与索引条目对应的实际分片张量"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:65
msgid "declared total size when present"
msgstr "存在时声明的总大小"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:66
msgid "compressed-tensors manifest-declared weights and scales"
msgstr "compressed-tensors 清单声明的权重和 scale"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:67
msgid "INT4 and INT8 storage shapes and metadata"
msgstr "INT4 和 INT8 存储形状及元数据"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:68
msgid "native GPTQ tensors such as `qweight`, `qzeros`, `scales`, and `g_idx`"
msgstr "原生 GPTQ 张量，例如 `qweight`、`qzeros`、`scales` 和 `g_idx`"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:69
msgid "native AWQ tensors such as `qweight`, `qzeros`, and `scales`"
msgstr "原生 AWQ 张量，例如 `qweight`、`qzeros` 和 `scales`"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:70
msgid "`config.json` quantization configuration and method metadata"
msgstr "`config.json` 中的量化配置和方法元数据"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:71
msgid "supported dynamic-token INT8 activation declarations for W8A8 output"
msgstr "W8A8 输出支持的动态 token INT8 激活声明"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:72
msgid "tokenizer and supporting files when they are preserved by the source model"
msgstr "源模型保留 tokenizer 和支持文件时的这些文件"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:74
msgid ""
"Validation does not decode packed words to prove nibble or byte-code "
"semantics. It also does not independently prove every mathematical "
"relationship between physical storage and logical shape, and it cannot prove"
" that an orphan manifest entry has a corresponding tensor in every possible "
"malformed artifact."
msgstr "验证不会解码打包字来证明半字节或字节码语义。它也不会独立证明物理存储与逻辑形状之间的每一个数学关系，并且无法证明孤立清单条目在所有可能的畸形工件中都有对应张量。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:76
msgid "Understand what validation does not check"
msgstr "了解验证不会检查什么"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:78
msgid "Validation does not prove:"
msgstr "验证不能证明："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:80
msgid "the target inference framework can load the artifact"
msgstr "目标推理框架能够加载该工件"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:81
msgid ""
"the target accelerator has W4A16, W8A16, W8A8, GPTQ, AWQ, or AutoRound "
"kernels"
msgstr "目标加速器具备 W4A16、W8A16、W8A8、GPTQ、AWQ 或 AutoRound 内核"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:82
msgid "the runtime selected the intended kernel rather than a fallback"
msgstr "运行时选择了预期内核而不是回退路径"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:83
msgid "accuracy is acceptable"
msgstr "准确率可接受"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:84
msgid "memory usage, latency, TTFT, TPOT, or throughput meets production goals"
msgstr "内存使用、延迟、TTFT、TPOT 或吞吐量满足生产目标"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:85
msgid "tensor parallel settings are correct"
msgstr "张量并行设置正确"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:86
msgid "the model is ready for production"
msgstr "模型已可用于生产"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:88
msgid "Run runtime loading checks"
msgstr "运行运行时加载检查"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:90
msgid ""
"After structural validation, load the model in the target runtime. The "
"runtime must support:"
msgstr "结构验证之后，在目标运行时中加载模型。运行时必须支持："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:92
msgid ""
"Reading `config.json` and its `quantization_config` or native method "
"metadata."
msgstr "读取 `config.json` 及其 `quantization_config` 或原生方法元数据。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:93
msgid "Loading the declared compressed-tensors, GPTQ, AWQ, or AutoRound ABI."
msgstr "加载声明的 compressed-tensors、GPTQ、AWQ 或 AutoRound ABI。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:94
msgid "Mapping the exact model architecture and layer names."
msgstr "映射确切的模型架构和层名称。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:95
msgid ""
"Executing the required Linear or MoE kernel path, or a verified correctness "
"fallback."
msgstr "执行所需的 Linear 或 MoE 内核路径，或已验证正确性的回退路径。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:96
msgid ""
"Fitting tensor parallelism, KV cache, workspace, communication buffers, "
"graph capture, and framework overhead into available memory."
msgstr "使张量并行、KV cache、工作区、通信缓冲区、图捕获和框架开销都能放入可用内存。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:98
msgid "Example online serving command for a compatible vLLM environment:"
msgstr "兼容 vLLM 环境的在线服务命令示例："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:107
msgid "Example offline smoke test:"
msgstr "离线冒烟测试示例："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:123
msgid ""
"vLLM can support compressed-tensors for particular combinations of version, "
"model, hardware, and quantization scheme. See the [vLLM compressed-tensors "
"integration "
"guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/stable/features/quantization/llm_compressor/)"
" and [vLLM quantization support "
"matrix](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/stable/features/quantization/), then verify "
"the exact target combination independently. The `compressed-tensors` package"
" describes and stores quantized weights but does not provide a kernel for "
"every framework or accelerator."
msgstr ""
"vLLM 可以在特定的版本、模型、硬件和量化方案组合下支持 compressed-tensors。请参见 [vLLM compressed-"
"tensors integration "
"guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/stable/features/quantization/llm_compressor/)"
" 和 [vLLM quantization support "
"matrix](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/stable/features/quantization/)，然后独立验证确切的目标组合"
"。`compressed-tensors` 包描述并存储量化权重，但不会为每个框架或加速器提供内核。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:125
msgid "Check runtime logs for:"
msgstr "检查运行时日志中的以下内容："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:127
msgid "recognition of the declared quantization method"
msgstr "是否识别声明的量化方法"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:128
msgid "the expected W4A16, W8A16, W8A8, GPTQ, AWQ, or AutoRound path"
msgstr "预期的 W4A16、W8A16、W8A8、GPTQ、AWQ 或 AutoRound 路径"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:129
msgid "a compatible Dense or MoE kernel path"
msgstr "兼容的 Dense 或 MoE 内核路径"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:130
msgid "absence of unexpected fallback or dequantization"
msgstr "没有意外回退或反量化"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:131
msgid "the actual tensor-parallel and memory settings"
msgstr "实际的张量并行和内存设置"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:133
msgid ""
"If vLLM or another runtime fails to load, do not conclude from that failure "
"alone that the model files are invalid. Check the runtime version, model "
"architecture mapping, hardware support, driver and device runtime, and "
"kernel availability."
msgstr "如果 vLLM 或其他运行时加载失败，不要仅凭该失败就断定模型文件无效。请检查运行时版本、模型架构映射、硬件支持、驱动和设备运行时以及内核可用性。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:135
msgid "Test target platforms"
msgstr "测试目标平台"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:137
msgid "Use the actual backend name registered by the local PyTorch extension:"
msgstr "使用本地 PyTorch 扩展实际注册的后端名称："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:53
msgid "Target"
msgstr "目标"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:53
msgid "Generation or loading guidance"
msgstr "生成或加载指导"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:53
msgid "NVIDIA GPU"
msgstr "NVIDIA GPU"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:53
msgid ""
"Use the compatible CUDA, PyTorch, driver, and runtime stack, commonly "
"`--backend cuda --device cuda:0`"
msgstr "使用兼容的 CUDA、PyTorch、驱动和运行时栈，常见为 `--backend cuda --device cuda:0`"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:53
msgid "PPU"
msgstr "PPU"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:53
msgid ""
"Use the backend and device identifiers registered by the PPU PyTorch "
"extension"
msgstr "使用 PPU PyTorch 扩展注册的后端和设备标识符"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:53
msgid "Haiguang DCU"
msgstr "海光 DCU"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:53
msgid ""
"Use the backend and device identifiers registered by the DCU PyTorch "
"extension"
msgstr "使用 DCU PyTorch 扩展注册的后端和设备标识符"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:53
msgid "Other accelerator"
msgstr "其他加速器"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:53
msgid ""
"Use the actual registered PyTorch backend name rather than inferring it from"
" the vendor name"
msgstr "使用实际注册的 PyTorch 后端名称，而不是从厂商名称推断"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:146
msgid ""
"If the target extension or quantization operator is not ready, generate on "
"CPU or CUDA and copy the artifact to the target environment for independent "
"loading, correctness, memory, and performance testing. Conversion and non-"
"calibrated MSE may use operation-level CPU fallback. Calibrated GPTQ, AWQ, "
"and AutoRound execution requires an available backend and does not silently "
"fall back to CPU."
msgstr ""
"如果目标扩展或量化算子尚未就绪，请在 CPU 或 CUDA 上生成，并将工件复制到目标环境中进行独立的加载、正确性、内存和性能测试。转换和非校准 MSE"
" 可以使用算子级 CPU 回退。校准式 GPTQ、AWQ 和 AutoRound 执行需要可用后端，不会静默回退到 CPU。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:148
msgid "Run accuracy and performance tests"
msgstr "运行准确性和性能测试"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:150
msgid ""
"Compare every candidate with an unquantized or BF16 reference using the same"
" model revision, tokenizer, prompts, runtime version, hardware, tensor-"
"parallel configuration, and workload."
msgstr "使用相同的模型修订版本、tokenizer、prompt、运行时版本、硬件、张量并行配置和工作负载，将每个候选方案与未量化或 BF16 参考进行比较。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:152
msgid "Record at least:"
msgstr "至少记录："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:154
msgid "task or evaluation dataset and prompt format"
msgstr "任务或评估数据集以及 prompt 格式"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:155
msgid "exact output comparison or score"
msgstr "精确输出对比或分数"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:156
msgid "peak memory and memory allocation settings"
msgstr "峰值内存和内存分配设置"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:157
msgid "time to first token, or TTFT"
msgstr "首 token 时间，即 TTFT"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:158
msgid "time per output token, or TPOT"
msgstr "每输出 token 时间，即 TPOT"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:159
msgid "prompt and generation throughput"
msgstr "prompt 和生成吞吐量"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:160
msgid "batch size, sequence lengths, concurrency, and tensor parallel size"
msgstr "批大小、序列长度、并发度和张量并行大小"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:161
msgid "kernel and fallback messages"
msgstr "内核和回退消息"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:162
msgid "failures, hangs, and long-run stability"
msgstr "失败、卡住以及长时间运行稳定性"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:164
msgid ""
"A successful generation command is functional evidence only. It is not by "
"itself accuracy, memory, throughput, or production evidence."
msgstr "成功的生成命令只是功能性证据。它本身并不是准确性、内存、吞吐量或生产可用性的证据。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:166
msgid "Execute the recommended test matrix"
msgstr "执行推荐测试矩阵"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:168
msgid ""
"Use a fresh output directory for every case. Run `inspect`, dry-run, "
"generation, `validate`, runtime loading, and the applicable quality tests "
"for each case."
msgstr "每个用例都使用新的输出目录。对每个用例运行 `inspect`、空运行、生成、`validate`、运行时加载以及适用的质量测试。"

