#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:187
msgid ""
"The D04 policy uses W8A16 channel for ordinary attention weights and omits "
"`--group-size`. W8A16 channel is still invalid for routed MoE; use W8A16 "
"group there. W8A8 routed MoE is allowed when the complete W8A8 combination "
"is used. Do not run quantization again on an already generated compressed-"
"tensors artifact to combine cases. Start from the original source checkpoint"
" for each case."
msgstr ""
"D04 策略对普通注意力权重使用 W8A16 channel，并省略 `--group-size`。W8A16 channel 仍不适用于路由 "
"MoE；那里请使用 W8A16 group。使用完整 W8A8 组合时允许 W8A8 路由 MoE。不要为了组合用例而对已生成的 compressed-"
"tensors 工件再次运行量化。每个用例都应从原始源 checkpoint 开始。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:189
msgid "Release acceptance checklist"
msgstr "发布验收检查清单"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:191
msgid "For every candidate released to users:"
msgstr "对于发布给用户的每个候选方案："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:193
msgid "Save source model name, revision, and directory integrity information."
msgstr "保存源模型名称、修订版本和目录完整性信息。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:194
msgid "Save the actual `git rev-parse HEAD` output."
msgstr "保存实际的 `git rev-parse HEAD` 输出。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:195
msgid "Save `inspect --json` output."
msgstr "保存 `inspect --json` 输出。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:196
msgid "Save the complete command line or recipe."
msgstr "保存完整命令行或 recipe。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:197
msgid "Confirm `unmatched quantized: 0` in dry-run output."
msgstr "确认空运行输出中 `unmatched quantized: 0`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:198
msgid "Explain any CPU fallback in the generation report."
msgstr "在生成报告中说明任何 CPU 回退。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:199
msgid "Confirm `validate` returns `Valid`."
msgstr "确认 `validate` 返回 `Valid`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:200
msgid "Preserve the manifest and report when the compressed-tensors path emits them."
msgstr "当 compressed-tensors 路径生成清单和报告时，请予以保留。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:201
msgid ""
"Complete BF16 or floating-point A/B accuracy testing in the same runtime "
"stack."
msgstr "在同一运行时栈中完成 BF16 或浮点 A/B 准确性测试。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:202
msgid ""
"Complete actual loading tests on each target platform, including NVIDIA GPU,"
" PPU, and Haiguang DCU when those targets are claimed."
msgstr "在每个目标平台上完成实际加载测试；声明支持 NVIDIA GPU、PPU 和海光 DCU 时也包括这些平台。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:203
msgid "Record inference framework, PyTorch, driver, and device runtime versions."
msgstr "记录推理框架、PyTorch、驱动和设备运行时版本。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:204
msgid "Record the selected kernels and any fallback path."
msgstr "记录选中的内核和任何回退路径。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:205
msgid "Complete memory, TTFT, TPOT, throughput, and stability tests."
msgstr "完成内存、TTFT、TPOT、吞吐量和稳定性测试。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:206
msgid "Complete expert and multi-device communication tests for Qwen3.5 MoE."
msgstr "完成 Qwen3.5 MoE 的专家和多设备通信测试。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:207
msgid "Confirm actual MLA and expert selection counts for DeepSeek-class models."
msgstr "确认 DeepSeek 类模型的实际 MLA 和专家选择数量。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:208
msgid "Keep the original source and previous stable artifact for rollback."
msgstr "保留原始源和上一个稳定工件以便回滚。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:210
msgid "Write a reproducible support conclusion"
msgstr "编写可复现的支持结论"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:212
msgid ""
"Do not report only that a model or chip is supported. Record the exact "
"evidence boundary:"
msgstr "不要只报告某个模型或芯片受支持。请记录确切的证据边界："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:225
msgid ""
"This format distinguishes five different claims: the tool generated an "
"artifact, the artifact passed structural validation, the runtime loaded it, "
"the target hardware used a supported kernel path, and the measured quality "
"and performance met the stated goal."
msgstr "这种格式区分了五种不同声明：工具生成了工件、工件通过了结构验证、运行时加载了它、目标硬件使用了受支持的内核路径，以及测得的质量和性能达到了声明目标。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:227
msgid "Fallbacks"
msgstr "回退处理"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:229
msgid "If structural validation passes but runtime loading fails:"
msgstr "如果结构验证通过但运行时加载失败："

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:231
msgid ""
"Verify inference framework support for the declared `quantization_config` or"
" native method metadata."
msgstr "验证推理框架是否支持声明的 `quantization_config` 或原生方法元数据。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:232
msgid "Check PyTorch, driver, device runtime, and framework versions."
msgstr "检查 PyTorch、驱动、设备运行时和框架版本。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:233
msgid "Confirm the target hardware has matching kernels."
msgstr "确认目标硬件具备匹配的内核。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:234
msgid "Check model architecture and tensor-name mapping."
msgstr "检查模型架构和张量名称映射。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:235
msgid "Test smaller tensor-parallel settings and memory limits."
msgstr "测试更小的张量并行设置和内存限制。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:236
msgid "Compare runtime logs with `quantization_report.json` when that report exists."
msgstr "当 `quantization_report.json` 存在时，将运行时日志与其进行比较。"

#: ../../source/how-to/validate-outputs.md:237
msgid ""
"Treat CPU fallback as functional evidence only. It does not establish "
"accelerator performance or deployment compatibility."
msgstr "仅将 CPU 回退视为功能性证据。它不能证明加速器性能或部署兼容性。"

